description.narrative:
Output: Strengthening of capacity building installed Indicator: Training includes:
(i) Capacity building program conducted for operation and maintenance of BESS and solar PV system with at least 50% participation of women (contractors/electric societies/community members)3;
(ii) Yearly business/ income generation skills training with men and women in each of the project sites, including modules on intrahousehold decision-making, sharing household labor and financial access and control;
(iii) 2 trainings per year on project planning and asset management maintenance with 30% participation of women (contractors/electric committees/community members)4; and
(iv) Training on sexual harassment and abuse for all MEIDECC, TPL and contractors involved in the project. Progress/Status: (i) Completed in Jun 2025; (ii) Held in Feb 2024 and Nov 2024 for the Haapai outer islands and in May/Jun 2025 for the Vavau outer islands; (iii) Haapai training in Dec 2023 and Nov 2024. Vavau training in May/Jun 2025; and (iv) Completed for TREP-01, TREP-02, TREP-03 Lot 1 and Lot 2 and TREP-12 contracts. Data Source: Project progress reports, TPL annual report, semiannual safeguards monitoring reports, training attendance sheets, and ADB&#65533;s project completion report Baseline year: 2017 Baseline value: N Baseline year: 2017 Baseline value: N Target year: 2025 Target value: Y
